<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0"/>
  <title>Bienvenido/a</title>

  <style>
   
    body {
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      background-color: #f4f6f8;
      font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
    }

    .container {
      max-width: 600px;
      margin: 40px auto;
      background: #ffffff;
      border-radius: 12px;
      overflow: hidden;
      box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.08);
    }

    .navbar {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1d3557, #457b9d);
      padding: 16px 24px;
      color: #ffffff;
    }

    .brand {
      font-size: 20px;
      font-weight: bold;
      text-decoration: none;
      color: #ffffff;
    }

    .info {
      margin-top: 8px;
      font-size: 14px;
      opacity: 0.9;
    }

    .header {
      padding: 40px 30px;
      text-align: center;
      background: #f8fafc;
    }

    .header h1 {
      margin: 0;
      font-size: 26px;
      color: #1d3557;
    }

    .content {
      padding: 30px;
      color: #333333;
      font-size: 16px;
      line-height: 1.6;
      text-align: center;
    }

    .content p {
      margin-bottom: 24px;
    }

    .btn {
      display: inline-block;
      padding: 14px 28px;
      background: #457b9d;
      color: #ffffff !important;
      text-decoration: none;
      border-radius: 30px;
      font-weight: bold;
      font-size: 15px;
    }

    .footer {
      background: #f1f3f5;
      padding: 16px;
      font-size: 12px;
      color: #777777;
      text-align: center;
    }
  </style>
</head>

<body>
  <div class="container">

    <div class="navbar">
      <a class="brand" href="#">TechStore 💻</a>
      <div class="info">👤 {{email}}</div>
    </div>

    
    <div class="header">
      <h1>{{text}}</h1>
    </div>

    
    <div class="content">
      <p>
        Gracias por registrarte en <strong>TechStore</strong>.  
        Ya podés explorar nuestros productos y ofertas exclusivas.
      </p>

      <a href="/register" class="btn">Ir a la tienda 🚀</a>
    </div>

    
    <div class="footer">
      © TechStore · Todos los derechos reservados
    </div>

  </div>
</body>
</html>
